flowchart LR
    Runtime[ADL Runtime provider substrate]
    Selector[Provider route selector]
    Codec[Shared Gemini semantic codec]
    Dev[Gemini Developer API transport]
    Vertex[Vertex AI Gemini transport]
    Auth[ADC / workload identity token boundary]
    Endpoint[Project + location + publisher + model endpoint]
    Receipt[Provider receipt + telemetry]

    Runtime --> Selector
    Selector --> Dev
    Selector --> Vertex
    Dev --> Codec
    Vertex --> Codec
    Vertex --> Auth
    Vertex --> Endpoint
    Dev --> Receipt
    Vertex --> Receipt

    Receipt -. redacts .-> Auth
    Receipt -. distinguishes .-> Dev
    Receipt -. distinguishes .-> Vertex
